www/docs/

# Pulumi
# NOTE-RT: `Pulumi.yaml` and `Pulumi.<stack>.yaml` are deliberately *not* ignored — the whole point
# of `infrastructure/` is that the configuration is in version control. Only local scratch is.
infrastructure/bin/
infrastructure/Pulumi.*.yaml.bak
